        "created_at": "2017-07-25T22:15:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Glad they sorted out my confusion of when they fought the Ennead.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Even though they only fought them once, it was both before and after Vengeance. They should fire all their writers and hire new ones. .&nbsp;. But I am glad they pointed out a fault in Comics where they reuse stories every 10 to 20 years. We Are on&nbsp;Civil was 2, Secret Wars 4, and how many rebirths lately.</p>",
