        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>After hearing the way Christopher pronounces it, I cannot resist saying:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;She turned me into a Nuit!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm just glad they used the correct pronunciation! It's bothered me for years that her name is misspelled in the card game. It's not a big bother, because it's the sort of mistake that would probably happen in the comics, but there you have it.&nbsp;</p>",
