        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Trajector wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>After hearing the way Christopher pronounces it, I cannot resist saying:    She turned me into a Nuit!\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I’m just glad they used the correct pronunciation! It’s bothered me for years that her name is misspelled in the card game. It’s not a big bother, because it’s the sort of mistake that would probably happen in the comics, but there you have it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, if they wanted to spell it correctly they’d have to use hieroglyphs, wouldn’t they?</p>",
