        "raw": "[quote=\"FrivYeti\"]\n\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Trajector wrote:</b><br />\n<blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">After hearing the way Christopher pronounces it, I cannot resist saying:    She turned me into a Nuit!\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n\nI'm just glad they used the correct pronunciation! It's bothered me for years that her name is misspelled in the card game. It's not a big bother, because it's the sort of mistake that would probably happen in the comics, but there you have it. \n\n[/quote]\n Well, if they wanted to spell it correctly they'd have to use hieroglyphs, wouldn't they?",
